OL,3,AThousands struggling without power in
OL,4,AIndiana 12 days after severe storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly two weeks after a damaging storm
OL,7,Fstruck her town in Indiana, Terry
OL,8,FDubois is one of tens of thousands of
OL,9,Fpeople still without power.
OL,11,FThe 77-year-old has been relying on
OL,12,Ffriends to bring her non-perishable
OL,13,Ffood to eat.
OL,15,FHer son brought her a power bank so she
OL,16,Fcan charge her phone and keep in touch
OL,17,Fwith the outside world.
OL,19,FThankfully, the summer heat hasn't been
OL,20,Ftoo punishing, Dubois said, meaning she
OL,21,Fhas not missed her air conditioning too
OL,22,Fmuch.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
